{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29592","headline":"崇让宅东亭醉後沔然有作 · 李商隐","name":"崇让宅东亭醉後沔然有作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曲岸风雷罢，东亭霁日凉。\n新秋仍酒困，幽兴暂江乡。\n摇落真何遽，交亲或未忘。\n一帆彭蠡月，数雁塞门霜。\n俗态虽多累，仙标发近狂。\n声名佳句在，身世玉琴张。\n万古山空碧，无人鬓免黄。\n骅骝忧老大，鶗鴂妬芬芳。\n密竹沉虚籁，孤莲泊晚香。\n如何此幽胜，淹卧剧清漳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29592.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29592","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}